   "sql": "SELECT o.id, o.status, o.ordered_at::date AS day\nFROM orders AS o\nWHERE o.customer_id = 7\nORDER BY o.ordered_at DESC\nLIMIT 3",
   "note": "for Ming Li, c.id = 7. she has never ordered, so the subquery returns no rows.",
   "status": "ok",
   "result": {
    "command": "SELECT",
